  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II NURTURE - Nurturing SDGs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NURTURE project aims to improve the capacity of three education programs (eHealth, informatics, and special needs) in five universities in Ethiopia. The project offers a response to the quest for rethinking higher education in LMICs by prioritizing on quality of education, job creation, improved digital access, and inclusion of female and disadvantaged groups.</narrative>
  </description>
